            "quotation_match": "exact",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "The Committee decided to keep the target range for the federal funds rate at 0 to 1/4 percent and expects it will be appropriate to maintain this target range until labor market conditions have"
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "美联储将继续推进资产购买以支持其充分就业和物价稳定目标，并在未来会议上评估进展；经济已朝这些目标取得进展。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
