            "location": {
              "character_start": 7481,
              "character_end": 7673
            },
            "quotation_match": "exact",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "Since then, the economy has made progress toward these goals, and the Committee will continue to assess progress in coming meetings. These asset purchases help foster smooth market functioning"
